Symbol Samples:
  [x] Done
  [-] Cancelled/Failed
  [] Incomplete

Sample Tags:
  @tag
  @today
  @low
  @high
  @critical

Shortcuts:
  [] Option+Enter = New Task
  [x] Option+D = Done
  [-] Option+C = Cancelled
  [] Option+S = Started @started(26-07-24 08:05)

Formatting:
  [] *Bold* = bold
  [] _italic_ = italic
  [] ~Strikethrough~ = Strikethrough
  [] `Code` = Code

  
